{"slug":"Criminality-KuniHub-for-Legit-gameplay-39538","_id":"681fd59219d50c23e29f95c3","title":"KuniHub for Legit gameplay","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77db6","gameId":4588604953,"name":"[⚙️] Criminality","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-414131eae53a4f991e29eb09b0fcd37d-4f3057f9f89e.png","placeId":4588604953},"features":"--== Aimbot Legit Tab ==--\n\n--aimbot (toggle to enable/disable aim assist)\n--Fov slider (set aimbot FOV range)\n--smoothness X (horizontal aim smoothing)\n--smoothness Y (vertical aim smoothing)\n\n--enable prediction (toggle on/off)\n--base prediction (single value override for X and Y)\n--prediction X (horizontal prediction multiplier)\n--prediction Y (vertical prediction multiplier)\n\n--direction reaction delay (adds human-like reaction to movement changes)\n\n--force field check (ignores targets with force fields)\n--wallcheck (checks if the target is visible)\n--distance smoothing factor (adjusts aim speed based on distance)\n\n--== ESP Features Tab ==--\n\n--esp (toggle on/off to display enemy info)\n--esp max distance (maximum distance ESP can render players)\n\n--safe esp (highlights unopened safes nearby)\n--safe esp distance \n--toggle safe esp (keybind to toggle safe esp)\n\n--== Miscellaneous Tab ==--\n\n--full brightness (removes lighting effects for max visibility)\n\n--ambient color (adjusts indoor light tint)\n--outdoor ambient color (adjusts outdoor light tint)\n--reset ambient colors (reverts to default lighting)\n\n--enable time changer \n--time changer (sets in-game time of day)\n\n--lockpick (bigger pin bars to simplify lockpicking minigame)\n--infinite stamina","tags":["legit","Criminality","Crim"],"script":"--Would recommend using Swift, because Velocity breaks the ESP health bar.\n--This is a Criminality script for LEGIT PLAYERS, not for raging, so it's safe to use on your main.\n--Fixed some features amd added some suggested tweaks.\n--Version v1.7\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Kunozx/Crim-script/refs/heads/main/KuniHub.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6215d181c499e7904b2bef56-1746916168090.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"https://lootdest.org/s?eIcyOlkJ","views":10974,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-3fbcd9220163919dae4df6228dad2d43-b1acd76d9691.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-05-10T22:39:14.200Z","editBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56"},"executes":183,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"681fd59219d50c23e29f95c5","editBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-05-10T22:39:14.203Z"},{"_id":"681fdcdaaafe4b1b91014298","editBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-05-10T23:10:18.522Z"},{"_id":"682063794e884918d4ba044b","editBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-05-11T08:44:41.417Z"},{"_id":"6828d90f7a06d4287b8ebe54","editBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","status":"offline","id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-05-17T18:44:31.849Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"681fd5de18aa92fdfa23854a","commentBy":{"_id":"6215d181c499e7904b2bef56","username":"Kuni","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/6215d181c499e7904b2bef56-1746916168090.jpg","createdAt":"2022-02-23T06:17:37.807Z","lastActive":"2026-05-25T23:10:34.180Z","status":"offline","id":"6